    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_11115e47",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black man wearing a pink cap and a white robe, smiling broadly in a forest setting. The overlaid text reads: 'So, you think by being a muslim sympathizer, this will somehow keep us from killing you? you are a special kind of stupid.' This text is a direct, hostile, and racially charged attack that combines Islamophobia (by associating Muslim sympathizers with violence and stupidity) with anti-Black racism (by using a Black person as the target of a degrading insult). The meme uses the juxtaposition of the man's cheerful expression with the hateful text to create a jarring, mocking effect, implying that the person being addressed is foolish for thinking they are safe from violence due to their sympathy for Muslims. The intent is to dehumanize and insult the target group, promoting hatred and division. The meme is clearly hateful as it directly attacks individuals based on their religious affiliation and race, and it is also harmful as it can incite violence and reinforce dangerous stereotypes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_ed5f7c66"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
