      "instance_name": "islamophobia",
      "label": "Islamophobia",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Muslims or Muslim sympathizers are inherently violent or dangerous, as implied by the text 'this will somehow keep us from killing you?'. This is a common antisemitic and Islamophobic trope that falsely equates religious affiliation with terrorism and barbarism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
