      "instance_name": "hateful_text_juxtaposition",
      "label": "Hateful Text Juxtaposition",
      "description": "The meme's impact relies on the juxtaposition of the man's cheerful expression with the hateful text. This visual contrast is a common rhetorical device in hate memes to mock or dehumanize the target, requiring understanding of how such juxtapositions are used to amplify hostility.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
