      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "stereotype_of_muslim_sympathizers_as_violent",
      "label": "Stereotype of Muslim Sympathizers as Violent",
      "description": "The text assumes that being a Muslim sympathizer makes one vulnerable to violence, which is a dangerous and false stereotype. This stereotype is part of broader Islamophobic narratives that portray Muslim sympathizers as threats to Western society.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
