      "label": "Stereotype of Black People as Stupid",
      "description": "The phrase 'you are a special kind of stupid' directly invokes a racist stereotype that Black people are inherently unintelligent. This is a form of racial dehumanization that has historical roots in American slavery and segregation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_ed5f7c66"
